      <title>AI Agent 为何在生产环境中持续失败，以及该构建什么替代方案</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260905/AI-Agent-%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%95%E5%9C%A8%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%A7%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E4%B8%AD%E6%8C%81%E7%BB%AD%E5%A4%B1%E8%B4%A5%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%8A%E8%AF%A5%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%9B%BF%E4%BB%A3%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88/</link>
